Upstream
--------
This repository contains work based on Maia-3 by the CSSLab Maia team
(University of Toronto), https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3, licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. Model weights referenced by the export
script are published by UofTCSSLab on Hugging Face.

Modifications
-------------
2026-07-18  export/export_onnx.py: ONNX export of the Maia-3 model. Re-expresses
            multi-head attention, RMSNorm and the promotion-logit loop with
            primitive ops for onnxruntime-web, with parity checks against the
            original forward pass.
2026-07-18  browser/tokenizer.ts: TypeScript port of the maia3.dataset
            tokenization chain for in-browser inference.
